  "abstract": "Generalization check on stronger baseline: combine static Mixture-of-Timescales head (R=4, \u03b1=0.07) with Huber(\u03b4=0.01) on H=160 ScalarRamp. Tests whether the H=128 gain transfers to H=160 without early-step regressions.",
